title: "RSEP / Tide: Request-Centric Task Scheduling and Resource Allocation for the Things-Edge-Cloud Continuum - Artifact"
abstract: >-
  Curated artifact for the IEEE TMC manuscript. Contains the Tide runtime,
  experiment drivers, audited summary exports behind the reported figures and
  tables, and compact measured datasets.
